space-xs text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md mb-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-1\" data-path=\"trang-chu\" href=\"#\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\"\u003ehome\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eTrang chủ\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-tertiary\"\u003echevron_right\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-on-surface font-semibold\"\u003eGiỏ hàng của bạn\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/nav\u003e\n\u003c!-- Tiêu đề trang & Huy hiệu số lượng --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-space-sm pb-space-lg\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003ch1 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight\"\u003eGiỏ hàng của bạn\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-md text-label-md\" id=\"cart-total-badge\"\u003e\n          2 sản phẩm\n        \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-space-xs text-tertiary font-body-sm text-body-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary\"\u003esecurity\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eThanh toán bảo mật SSL 256-bit &amp; Khảo sát tận nơi\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Banner Ưu Đãi / Điều Kiện Giao Hàng & Lắp Đặt --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mb-space-lg p-space-md rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-start md:items-center gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0 shadow-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]\"\u003elocal_shipping\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eĐủ điều kiện nhận dịch vụ FANFUN Care Premium\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-variant text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm\"\u003eĐã kích hoạt\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\"\u003e\n            Miễn phí 100% chi phí vận chuyển liên tỉnh &amp; gói dịch vụ khảo sát trần, lắp đặt tận nhà từ kỹ thuật viên ủy quyền.\n          \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"h-2 w-32 bg-surface-container-highest rounded-full overflow-hidden\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"h-full bg-primary rounded-full w-full\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Bố cục Giỏ hàng đầy đủ (Active Cart State) --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-xl items-start\" id=\"cart-content-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- CỘT TRÁI: Danh sách sản phẩm (8 cols) --\u003e\n\u003csection aria-label=\"Danh sách mặt hàng\" class=\"lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Sản phẩm 1: Quạt trần FANFUN 3-IN-1 Living --\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"p-space-lg rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md relative\" id=\"item-fan-living\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Ảnh sản phẩm --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative w-full sm:w-36 h-36 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shrink-0 bg-surface-container\"\u003e\n\u003cimg class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" data-alt=\"Modern premium architectural ceiling fan FANFUN 3-in-1 Living with five dark walnut wooden blades, sleek integrated LED warm light ring and ceramic PTC heating air purifier body in a minimalist warm Scandinavian living room setting with natural daylight and terracotta clay pots.\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBUtUsxVCxChHSk_upCVWsjEe9Y190hEiQQdQARGobe7IaFPgw9x8cip-WKEcjXi9TrHofRxakkBzo-x4KK8LNY-vA8dABkOamLe02JPNN-B6VlC18xLf6ZjdWuiiGFRl90dDVaJBxTXkNzBNe7iFzAO4WXRs7HR3LTnsmQghhVFXacSLEMyb1vmEaZWAkNsphjugR6KZwDg40SjOsPvqX9RpAYIgKG7n9S2_Nx1Z8\"/\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm shadow-sm\"\u003e\n                Smart 3-in-1\n              \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Chi tiết sản phẩm --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-tertiary\"\u003eMã: FF-LIV-05WN\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\u003e\n                      Quạt trần thông minh FANFUN 3-IN-1 Living\n                    \u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Nút Xóa --\u003e\n\u003cbutton aria-label=\"Xóa sản phẩm quạt trần\" class=\"p-2 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-error hover:bg-error-container/20 rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"openDeleteModal('item-fan-living', 'Quạt trần thông minh FANFUN 3-IN-1 Living')\" title=\"Xóa khỏi giỏ hàng\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003edelete\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1\"\u003e\n                  Phiên bản 5 cánh gỗ Walnut tự nhiên, động cơ DC Inverter không ồn, sưởi gốm PTC &amp; màng lọc khí HEPA H13.\n                \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- Quyền lợi đi kèm --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-space-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-space-sm py-1 rounded bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[16px]\"\u003everified\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eMiễn phí khảo sát &amp; lắp đặt an toàn tại nhà (trị giá 450.000đ)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Thanh giá & Tăng giảm số lượng --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-space-md pt-space-sm flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-1\"\u003e\n\u003cbutton aria-label=\"Giảm số lượng\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shadow-sm\" onclick=\"updateQuantity('qty-fan', -1, 8990000, 'total-fan')\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\"\u003eremove\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"w-10 text-center font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface select-none\" id=\"qty-fan\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cbutton aria-label=\"Tăng số lượng\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shadow-sm\" onclick=\"updateQuantity('qty-fan', 1, 8990000, 'total-fan')\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\"\u003eadd\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-right\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003eĐơn giá: 8.990.000đ\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold\" id=\"total-fan\"\u003e\n                    8.990.000đ\n                  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Thông báo tồn kho sản phẩm --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-space-md flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-body-sm text-body-sm bg-primary-fixed/30 px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-lg\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\"\u003einventory_2\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eChỉ còn 3 sản phẩm trong kho sẵn sàng giao trong 24h\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/article\u003e\n\u003c!-- Sản phẩm 2: Lõi lọc thay thế True HEPA --\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"p-space-lg rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md relative\" id=\"item-filter-hepa\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Ảnh sản phẩm --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative w-full sm:w-36 h-36 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shrink-0 bg-surface-container\"\u003e\n\u003cimg class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" data-alt=\"Replacement dual composite air purifier filter cartridge cylinder with dense pleated True HEPA H13 white paper and black honeycomb activated carbon granules layer on an ivory stone pedestal with soft warm backlighting.\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDQQ6s06ykYtdzKyN4ZEF0ILAPqHtIINQubS64ccn2AeOyWx2RtdtEXbdXSflLZFNXVP6s1VgkKF7nJ48zGggCXvyrSU_Uz8dqgwjQKY0QCiRVHr0A5k8GkIXcs3bmIHf6077T9OK9Yq5hiM8MjDkjgMJxz7mI1Z8OlTuoInfhwsDeU2SkcT20HnPrJZ7fQgnH3Vt6WD0_MjmEMZjhvLxtkziB_8mBrQ_XKgOaMymU\"/\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-tertiary-container text-on-tertiary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm shadow-sm\"\u003e\n                Phụ kiện\n              \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Chi tiết sản phẩm --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-tertiary\"\u003eMã: FF-FLT-H13C\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\u003e\n                      Bộ lõi lọc kép thay thế True HEPA H13 &amp; Than hoạt tính FANFUN\n                    \u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Nút Xóa --\u003e\n\u003cbutton aria-label=\"Xóa lõi lọc\" class=\"p-2 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-error hover:bg-error-container/20 rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"openDeleteModal('item-filter-hepa', 'Bộ lõi lọc kép True HEPA H13 &amp; Than hoạt tính')\" title=\"Xóa khỏi giỏ hàng\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003edelete\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1\"\u003e\n                  Khử mùi Formaldehyde, lọc 99.97% bụi mịn PM2.5 và kháng khuẩn kép. Chu kỳ thay thế khuyến nghị: 6 - 8 tháng.\n                \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-space-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-space-sm py-1 rounded bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[16px]\"\u003eautorenew\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eTương thích hoàn hảo toàn bộ dòng quạt trần FANFUN 3-in-1\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Thanh giá & Tăng giảm số lượng --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-space-md pt-space-sm flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-1\"\u003e\n\u003cbutton aria-label=\"Giảm số lượng\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shadow-sm\" onclick=\"updateQuantity('qty-filter', -1, 650000, 'total-filter')\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\"\u003eremove\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"w-10 text-center font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface select-none\" id=\"qty-filter\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cbutton aria-label=\"Tăng số lượng\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shadow-sm\" onclick=\"updateQuantity('qty-filter', 1, 650000, 'total-filter')\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\"\u003eadd\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-right\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003eĐơn giá: 650.000đ\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold\" id=\"total-filter\"\u003e\n                    1.300.000đ\n                  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/article\u003e\n\u003c!-- Nút quay lại & Tiện ích bổ trợ --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-space-md flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003ca class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface hover:text-primary transition-colors py-2\" data-path=\"san-pham-he-sinh-thai\" href=\"#\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\"\u003earrow_back\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eTiếp tục mua sắm sản phẩm khác\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c!-- Nút kích hoạt mô phỏng Empty State để người dùng duyệt UI --\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"text-tertiary hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm underline transition-colors\" onclick=\"toggleEmptyCartDemo()\" type=\"button\"\u003e\n            (Mô phỏng hiển thị giỏ hàng trống)\n          \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/section\u003e\n\u003c!-- CỘT PHẢI: Tóm tắt đơn hàng & Cam kết an tâm (4 cols) --\u003e\n\u003caside aria-label=\"Tóm tắt hóa đơn\" class=\"lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-space-md sticky top-24\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Card Tóm tắt --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-space-lg rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-md\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface pb-space-sm\"\u003e\n            Tóm tắt đơn hàng\n          \u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"space-y-space-sm py-space-md font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eTạm tính (3 sản phẩm)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface\" id=\"summary-subtotal\"\u003e10.290.000đ\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"\u003e\n                Phí vận chuyển toàn quốc\n                \u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-tertiary cursor-help\" title=\"Giao nhanh 24-48h\"\u003einfo\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-semibold text-primary\"\u003eMiễn phí (0đ)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"\u003e\n                Khảo sát &amp; Lắp đặt tiêu chuẩn\n                \u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-tertiary cursor-help\" title=\"Bao gồm kiểm tra gia cố trần thạch cao/bê tông\"\u003einfo\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-semibold text-primary\"\u003eMiễn phí (0đ)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-space-xs rounded bg-surface-container-low text-tertiary font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-2\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary\"\u003esavings\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eBạn đã tiết kiệm được 750.000đ phí dịch vụ\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Mã khuyến mãi nhập nhanh --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"py-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex gap-2\"\u003e\n\u003cinput class=\"flex-1 px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline font-body-sm text-body-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary shadow-inner\" placeholder=\"Mã ưu đãi / Voucher\" type=\"text\"/\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors\"\u003e\n                Áp dụng\n              \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Tổng tiền --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-space-md mt-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface\"\u003eTổng thanh toán:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-right\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold block leading-none\" id=\"summary-total\"\u003e\n                  10.290.000đ\n                \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003eĐã bao gồm 10% VAT\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- CTA Chính: Tiến hành thanh toán --\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"w-full mt-space-lg py-3.5 px-space-lg rounded-xl bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg tracking-wide hover:bg-primary-container active:scale-[0.99] transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group\" type=\"button\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eTiến hành thanh toán\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\"\u003earrow_forward\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-center text-on-surface-variant mt-3\"\u003e\n            Hỗ trợ trả góp 0% lãi suất qua thẻ tín dụng từ 857.000đ/tháng\n          \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Cam kết An tâm (Trust Badges) --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-space-lg rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface mb-space-md uppercase tracking-wider\"\u003e\n            Đặc quyền an tâm từ FANFUN\n          \u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"space-y-space-md font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"\u003epublished_with_changes\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong class=\"text-on-surface block font-semibold\"\u003eĐổi mới 1 - 1 trong 30 ngày\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eÁp dụng tận nơi nếu phát sinh bất kỳ lỗi kỹ thuật nào từ nhà sản xuất.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"\u003everified_user\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong class=\"text-on-surface block font-semibold\"\u003eBảo hành chính hãng 5 năm\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eĐộng cơ DC bảo hành 5 năm, hệ thống điện tử thông minh bảo hành 2 năm tận nhà.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"\u003econstruction\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong class=\"text-on-surface block font-semibold\"\u003eKiểm tra kết cấu trần &amp; an toàn điện\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eKỹ sư lành nghề đo tải trọng trần, kiểm tra tiếp địa và nghiệm thu rung lắc trước khi bàn giao.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- KHU VỰC GIỎ HÀNG TRỐNG (Mô phỏng Empty Cart State - Mặc định ẩn) --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"hidden flex-col items-center justify-center py-space-xl px-space-md text-center bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl shadow-sm my-space-lg\" id=\"empty-cart-state\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative w-40 h-40 mb-space-lg flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-low\"\u003e\n\u003csvg class=\"w-24 h-24 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 96 96\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\u003e\n\u003cpath d=\"M28 28H16L24 64H72L80 28H28Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"4\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\n\u003cpath d=\"M40 76C42.2091 76 44 74.2091 44 72C44 69.7909 42.2091 68 40 68C37.7909 68 36 69.7909 36 72C36 74.2091 37.7909 76 40 76Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\n\u003cpath d=\"M68 76C70.2091 76 72 74.2091 72 72C72 69.7909 70.2091 68 68 68C65.7909 68 64 69.7909 64 72C64 74.2091 65.7909 76 68 76Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\n\u003cpath d=\"M48 20V40\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"4\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\n\u003cpath d=\"M38 30L48 20L58 30\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"4\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\n\u003c/svg\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-space-xs\"\u003e\n        Giỏ hàng của bạn đang trống\n      \u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-md mb-space-lg\"\u003e\n        Bạn chưa lựa chọn thiết bị làm mát hay phụ kiện lọc không khí thông minh nào. Hãy để FANFUN đồng hành mang bầu không khí trong lành đến ngôi nhà của bạn!\n      \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003ca class=\"px-space-xl py-3.5 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg shadow-md hover:bg-primary-container transition-all\" data-path=\"san-pham-he-sinh-thai\" href=\"#\"\u003e\n          Khám phá quạt thông minh FANFUN ngay\n        \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"px-space-lg py-3.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface font-label-lg text-label-lg hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\" onclick=\"toggleEmptyCartDemo()\"\u003e\n          Khôi phục sản phẩm mẫu\n        \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- MODAL XÁC NHẬN XÓA SẢN PHẨM --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-inverse-surface/40 backdrop-blur-sm hidden p-space-md\" id=\"delete-modal\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest max-w-md w-full rounded-2xl p-space-lg shadow-2xl relative\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-error-container text-error flex items-center justify-center mb-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\"\u003ewarning\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface\"\u003eBỏ sản phẩm khỏi giỏ hàng?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2\" id=\"delete-item-name\"\u003e\n        Bạn có chắc chắn muốn bỏ sản phẩm này khỏi giỏ hàng? Các ưu đãi lắp đặt miễn phí có thể bị thay đổi nếu tổng đơn giảm.\n      \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-space-lg flex items-center justify-end gap-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\" onclick=\"closeDeleteModal()\" type=\"button\"\u003e\n          Hủy bỏ\n        \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-error text-on-error font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-error/90 transition-colors shadow-sm\" onclick=\"confirmDelete()\" type=\"button\"\u003e\n          Xác nhận xóa\n        \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Script xử lý tương tác số lượng, tính tiền & xóa sản phẩm --\u003e\n\u003cscript\u003e\n    let activeDeleteId = null;\n\n    function formatVND(amount) {\n      return amount.toLocaleString('vi-VN') + 'đ';\n    }\n\n    function calculateCartTotals() {\n      const qtyFanElem = document.getElementById('qty-fan');\n      const qtyFilterElem = document.getElementById('qty-filter');\n\n      const fanExists = !!document.getElementById('item-fan-living');\n      const filterExists = !!document.getElementById('item-filter-hepa');\n\n      let qtyFan = (fanExists && qtyFanElem) ? parseInt(qtyFanElem.innerText, 10) : 0;\n      let qtyFilter = (filterExists && qtyFilterElem) ? parseInt(qtyFilterElem.innerText, 10) : 0;\n\n      const subtotal = (qtyFan * 8990000) + (qtyFilter * 650000);\n      const totalCount = qtyFan + qtyFilter;\n\n      const subtotalElem = document.getElementById('summary-subtotal');\n      const totalElem = document.getElementById('summary-total');\n      const badgeElem = document.getElementById('cart-total-badge');\n\n      if (subtotalElem) subtotalElem.innerText = formatVND(subtotal);\n      if (totalElem) totalElem.innerText = formatVND(subtotal);\n      if (badgeElem) badgeElem.innerText = totalCount + ' sản phẩm';\n\n      if (totalCount === 0) {\n        showEmptyCartView();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function updateQuantity(id, delta, unitPrice, totalElemId) {\n      const qtyElem = document.getElementById(id);\n      if (!qtyElem) return;\n\n      let current = parseInt(qtyElem.innerText, 10);\n      let updated = current + delta;\n\n      if (updated \u003c 1) {\n        const itemElem = qtyElem.closest('article');\n        if (itemElem) {\n          const title = itemElem.querySelector('h2') ? itemElem.querySelector('h2').innerText : 'sản phẩm';\n          openDeleteModal(itemElem.id, title);\n        }\n        return;\n      }\n\n      if (updated \u003e 10) {\n        alert('Số lượng tối đa cho mỗi đơn hàng online là 10 chiếc. Vui lòng liên hệ 1900 6868 nếu muốn đặt dự án lớn.');\n        return;\n      }\n\n      qtyElem.innerText = updated;\n      const totalEl = document.getElementById(totalElemId);\n      if (totalEl) {\n        totalEl.innerText = formatVND(updated * unitPrice);\n      }\n\n      calculateCartTotals();\n    }\n\n    function openDeleteModal(itemId, itemName) {\n      activeDeleteId = itemId;\n      const modal = document.getElementById('delete-modal');\n      const textElem = document.getElementById('delete-item-name');\n      if (textElem) {\n        textElem.innerText = `Bạn có chắc chắn muốn bỏ \"${itemName}\" khỏi giỏ hàng của mình?`;\n      }\n      if (modal) modal.classList.remove('hidden');\n    }\n\n    function closeDeleteModal() {\n      activeDeleteId = null;\n      const modal = document.getElementById('delete-modal');\n      if (modal) modal.classList.add('hidden');\n    }\n\n    function confirmDelete() {\n      if (activeDeleteId) {\n        const elem = document.getElementById(activeDeleteId);\n        if (elem) {\n          elem.remove();\n        }\n        calculateCartTotals();\n      }\n      closeDeleteModal();\n    }\n\n    function showEmptyCartView() {\n      const wrapper = document.getElementById('cart-content-wrapper');\n      const emptyState = document.getElementById('empty-cart-state');\n      if (wrapper) wrapper.classList.add('hidden');\n      if (emptyState) {\n        emptyState.classList.remove('hidden');\n        emptyState.classList.add('flex');\n      }\n    }\n\n    function toggleEmptyCartDemo() {\n      const wrapper = document.getElementById('cart-content-wrapper');\n      const emptyState = document.getElementById('empty-cart-state');\n      \n      if (wrapper.classList.contains('hidden')) {\n        wrapper.classList.remove('hidden');\n        emptyState.classList.add('hidden');\n        emptyState.classList.remove('flex');\n        location.reload(); // khôi phục trạng thái ban đầu\n      } else {\n        showEmptyCartView();\n      }\n    }\n  \u003c/script\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/main\u003e\u003cfooter class=\"w-full bg-surface-container-low mt-space-xl\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-gutter py-space-xl\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-space-lg mb-space-xl\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lg:col-span-2 space-y-space-md\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col select-none\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm tracking-tight text-primary leading-none\"\u003eFANFUN\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant uppercase mt-space-xs\"\u003eSmart Living\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-sm\"\u003eThoải mái quanh năm, thông minh mỗi ngày. Tiên phong giải pháp làm mát, thanh lọc không khí và chiếu sáng thông minh tích hợp kiến trúc Việt.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-sm pt-space-xs\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\"\u003everified_user\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBảo hành chính hãng 5 năm\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"space-y-space-md\"\u003e\u003ch4 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider\"\u003eSản phẩm\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul class=\"space-y-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eQuạt trần 3-in-1 Lumina\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eQuạt sàn Smart Breeze\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eLõi lọc HEPA &amp; Than hoạt tính\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eBộ điều khiển thông minh\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003ePhụ kiện thay thế\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"space-y-space-md\"\u003e\u003ch4 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider\"\u003eHỗ trợ &amp; Dịch vụ\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul class=\"space-y-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eĐặt lịch khảo sát &amp; Lắp đặt\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eChính sách bảo hành tại nhà\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eHướng dẫn kết nối App\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eTra cứu tình trạng đơn hàng\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eChính sách đổi trả 30 ngày\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"space-y-space-md\"\u003e\u003ch4 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider\"\u003eLiên hệ\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"space-y-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"flex items-start gap-space-xs\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px] mt-0.5\"\u003elocation_on\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKhu Công Nghệ Cao, TP. Thủ Đức, TP. Hồ Chí Minh\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]\"\u003ecall\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-semibold text-on-surface\"\u003e1900 6868\u003c/span\u003e (8h00 - 20h00)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]\"\u003email\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecskh@fanfun.vn\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"pt-space-lg flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-md text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e© 2025 FANFUN SMART LIVING. Tất cả quyền được bảo lưu.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-lg\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eĐiều khoản dịch vụ\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eChính sách bảo mật\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003eQuy chuẩn kỹ thuật\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/footer\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e"
}
